# 📖 About

The Tiger Hunter is a modern open-source educational project focused on networking, Python programming, algorithms, and system development.

The main goal of this repository is to help developers learn by reading clean, simple, and practical source code.

---

# ✨ Features

- 🚀 High Performance
- 🐍 Python Source Code
- 🌐 Networking Examples
- 📡 DNS Projects
- 🔒 Security Utilities
- 📚 Educational Algorithms
- 📂 Clean Project Structure
- 💡 Beginner Friendly
- ⚡ Fast & Lightweight
- ❤️ Open Source

