# 🚀 Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/The-Tiger-Hunter.git
cd The-Tiger-Hunter
```

## Create Virtual Environment (Optional)

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

### Linux / macOS

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

### Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

## Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run Project

```bash
python main.py
```

